 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Lots of people are, and there are ways to do it without actual crafting. Is there someone you want to surprise, and what do they like? Buy a tube of chocolate, a nice box of chocolates, or a gift box of mixed bites, then wrap it. The tube of chocolate costs almost nothing, a box of chocolates is reasonable, and a box of mix bites is a few pounds. Wrap whatever one feels right. Keep the wrapping paper simple so you can use it again, and put the gift inside a gift bag instead. Your loved one will probably figure out who it came from if you leave the wrapping paper, so don't tag it.",
